.TH QUANUX-CELL 7 "FEBRUARY 2026" "QuanuX Biological Sovereignty" "QuanuX System Manual"
.SH NAME
quanux-cell \- The Living Biological Architecture of QuanuX
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quanux-cell
.SH DESCRIPTION
QuanuX operates under the paradigm of \fBBiological Sovereignty\fR. 

The architecture is no longer interpreted as a set of rigid, industrial blocks or interconnected APIs. It is a living, breathing cell. The execution logic is mapped organically via form-fitting, protective membranes designed to insulate the central strategy from the toxic complexities of the external market environment.

We call this insulation the \fBRussian Doll Protocol\fR.
.SH THE NUCLEUS (The Strategy)
At the center of the Russian Doll sits the \fBStrategy\fR. This is the Nucleus. It is the absolute, latency-sensitive logic generator evaluating mathematical alphas. It is fragile on its own, easily corrupted by bad sensory data or mismanaged risk signals.
.SH THE INSULATING MEMBRANES (The Russian Dolls)
To protect the Nucleus, we employ distinct Organelles (adapters and risk evaluators) that wrap the core execution logic in defensive layers.
.TP
.BR 1.\ The\ Sensory\ Receptors\ (Membrane\ 1)
Adapters such as the QuickFIX and OnixS ingest raw, chaotic market data. These receptors process the external noise and translate it into clean, deterministic L3 structural snapshots.
.TP
.BR 2.\ The\ Immune\ System\ (Membrane\ 2)
The \fBSovereign Sentinel\fR. This organelle acts as the cell's immune system, physically scanning the state transitions inside the `SovereignState` 64-byte array. If the Nucleus attempts an action that violates exposure bounds (pathogens), the Sentinel forces the cell into \fBSTATE_HALT\fR (apoptosis).
.TP
.BR 3.\ The\ HDF5\ Vacuole\ (Membrane\ 3)
The \fBSovereign Vault\fR acts as the scribe and the memory vacuole, absorbing and storing the exact sequence of cellular events for 1:1 Parity replication and future transcription.
.SH THE INSTITUTIONAL PATHOGENS
The Russian Doll membranes explicitly exist to defend the QuanuX cell against the "Institutional 8" pathogens (e.g., Execution Jitter, External Latency Spikes, OS Scheduler Interference). For more details on the specific laws governing the Immune System, see \fBritchie-interlock(2)\fR.
